<td id="S5.T3.2.1.3.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t">In which direction is the pedestrian <span id="S5.T3.2.1.3.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">moving</span>?</td>
<td id="S5.T3.2.1.3.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t">What direction is the pedestrian moving in?</td></tr>
<tr id="S5.T3.2.1.4" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S5.T3.2.1.4.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_t">Cat.3-Synth</td>
<td id="S5.T3.2.1.4.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t">How many <span id="S5.T3.2.1.4.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">people</span> are crossing the road?</td>
<td id="S5.T3.2.1.4.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t">How many pedestrians are <span id="S5.T3.2.1.4.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">traversing</span> the road?</td>
<td id="S5.T3.2.1.4.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t">What is the number of people crossing the road?</td></tr>
