<td id="S5.T3.2.1.5.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t">Which of the truck’s blinkers, if any, is <span id="S5.T3.2.1.5.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">activated</span>?</td>
<td id="S5.T3.2.1.5.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t">Which turn indicator on the truck is active, if any?</td></tr>
