<td id="S5.T3.2.1.6.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_t">Cat.5-Synth</td>
<td id="S5.T3.2.1.6.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t">What colour is the <span id="S5.T3.2.1.6.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">stoplight</span>?</td>
<td id="S5.T3.2.1.6.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t">What colour <span id="S5.T3.2.1.6.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">shows</span> the traffic light?</td>
<td id="S5.T3.2.1.6.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t">What is the current colour of the traffic signal?</td></tr>
