<td id="S5.T3.2.1.7.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t">Which traffic <span id="S5.T3.2.1.7.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">symbol</span> is shown?</td>
<td id="S5.T3.2.1.7.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t">Which traffic sign is <span id="S5.T3.2.1.7.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">displayed</span>?</td>
<td id="S5.T3.2.1.7.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t">What traffic sign is visible in the image?</td></tr>
