<td id="S5.T3.2.1.8.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t">Are there any <span id="S5.T3.2.1.8.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">humans</span> in the image?</td>
<td id="S5.T3.2.1.8.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t">Are there any people <span id="S5.T3.2.1.8.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">appearing</span> in the image?</td>
<td id="S5.T3.2.1.8.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t">Do you see any humans present in the image?</td></tr>
